From: Bill Antoniadis <sysadmin@horseracinginfo.com>

	We are also running 3.51 (on DU 4.0D) and were getting a lot of 
server restarts forced by the watchdog.  This would happen mostly when our
server was being especially taxed.  We made lots of modifications to decrease
the load and saw that the restarts were very infrequent, so we concluded that
the restarts were dependent on the server load.  Another thing: restarts
don't necessarily mean that the server crashed, just that it was too slow in
responding to whatever the watchdog was requesting.

