QUESTION:
> How do I modify the screen resolution on my 255 workstation?  I'm looking
> for SRM console commands
> and UNIX commands.
ANSWER:
To change the screen resolution edit /usr/dt/config/Xservers.con
add -screen0 800 onto the end of the last line eg

:0   Local local@console /usr/bin/X11/X :0 -nice -2 -screen0 800

This will give a 800 x 600 display, add your required resolution ie 1024
etc.

You will have to reboot for the changes to take effect.

